tech_agent: 기술 (tech_agent) { class: ours }
update_tech: update_tech_overview { class: ours }

story_agent -> update_story: 호출 (요약 턴)
update_story -> ui: "Story overview: 요약"
gameplay_agent -> update_gameplay: 호출 (요약 턴)
update_gameplay -> ui: "Gameplay overview: 요약"
visuals_agent -> update_visuals: 호출 (요약 턴)
